% Counter-evidence to an exception, arriving through a derivation.
% The 0.6 injury exception gates the flight default; the vet rule derives
% evidence AGAINST the exception with strength 0.58. The derived counter is
% netted into the exception's own support exactly like the equivalent fact
% 0.58::-injured(a) would be: confidence 0.98.
bird(a).
0.6::injured(a).
vet(a).
0.58::-injured(X) :- vet(X).
flies(X) :- bird(X), unless(injured(X), 2).
query(flies(a)).
